# Copy to .env (git-ignored) ONLY if you intend to run paid benchmarks.
# Keys are read from the environment at run time and never written to any file
# by this project. Installing, testing and the offline demo need no keys.
#
# A paid run additionally requires:
#   1. config/providers.yaml (copied from providers.example.yaml) with enabled: true
#   2. the --allow-paid-api flag on the command line
#
# Load into your shell, e.g.:  set -a; source .env; set +a   (bash)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional: override repository root discovery
# NR_REPO_ROOT=
